        "sid": "1TH 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul, and Silvanus, and Timothy, unto the church of the Thessalonians in God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ: Grace to you and peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We give thanks to God always for you all, making mention ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in our prayers; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remembering without ceasing your work of faith and labor of love and patience of hope in our Lord Jesus Christ, before our God and Father; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "knowing, brethren beloved of God, your election, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "how that our gospel came not unto you in word only, but also in power, and in the Holy Spirit, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " much assurance; even as ye know what manner of men we showed ourselves toward you for your sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye became imitators of us, and of the Lord, having received the word in much affliction, with joy of the Holy Spirit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that ye became an ensample to all that believe in Macedonia and in Achaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For from you hath sounded forth the word of the Lord, not only in Macedonia and Achaia, but in every place your faith to God-ward is gone forth; so that we need not to speak anything. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they themselves report concerning us what manner of entering in we had unto you; and how ye turned unto God from idols, to serve a living and true God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to wait for his Son from heaven, whom he raised from the dead, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesus, who delivereth us from the wrath to come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
